WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
The fourth question is who they are.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:08.900
And the page was written to tell a story.

3
00:00:08.900 --> 00:00:12.700
Basecamp gives its age, never its year.

4
00:00:12.700 --> 00:00:16.400
So we report nothing. That is correct.

5
00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:19.500
Then it answered: zero people.

6
00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:23.000
The page said ten. The check agreed.

7
00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:26.800
A check that cannot fail is not a check.

8
00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:29.800
Numbers are whole tokens now.

9
00:00:29.800 --> 00:00:33.600
The next one threw away a right answer.

10
00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:37.600
One invented field killed the whole reply.

11
00:00:37.600 --> 00:00:41.300
And the window was in the wrong place.

12
00:00:41.300 --> 00:00:44.800
Two wrongs, looking like one right.

13
00:00:44.800 --> 00:00:48.000
One source was not even theirs.

14
00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:51.800
Only their own pages set a table value.

15
00:00:51.800 --> 00:00:55.100
Four pages. Four correct answers.

16
00:00:55.100 --> 00:00:58.300
Two of them were: the page does not say.
